formal_problem.en:
Integer definitions are given below. Evaluate them in order; × means multiplication and − means subtraction. All inputs needed for verification are provided here.

Definitions:
{definitions}

Among the following statements, exactly one is false. Find it by evaluating the definitions:
{statements}

Answer with its statement number (starting at 1) or the false assertion itself.

